---
---

<section id="pricing" class="py-24 bg-[#0a0d14] relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Inversión clara, escalabilidad infinita</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-mesh-muted">Modelo híbrido diseñado para empresas. Adquiere el hardware físico y suscríbete a la inteligencia en la nube.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      
      <!-- Hardware Plan -->
      <div class="bg-mesh-card border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 flex flex-col hover:border-white/20 transition-colors">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Plan Hardware (Player)</h3>
        <p class="text-mesh-muted mb-6">Dispositivo industrial de alta durabilidad pre-configurado.</p>
        <div class="mb-8">
          <span class="text-5xl font-extrabold text-white">$299</span>
          <span class="text-mesh-muted">/ pago único</span>
        </div>
        
        <ul class="space-y-4 mb-8 flex-grow">
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500 mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            <span class="text-gray-300">Gabinete metálico disipador de calor (Fanless)</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500 mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            <span class="text-gray-300">Arranque automático por USB/HDD al recibir energía</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500 mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            <span class="text-gray-300">Soporte técnico y configuración inicial incluidos</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500 mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            <span class="text-gray-300">Salida HDMI 4K @ 60Hz</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        
        <a href="#contact" class="w-full block text-center bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 border border-white/10 text-white font-bold py-3 px-4 rounded-xl transition-colors">
          Cotizar Volumen
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- SaaS Plan -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-b from-mesh-card to-mesh-dark border-2 border-mesh-accent rounded-2xl p-8 flex flex-col relative transform md:-translate-y-4 shadow-[0_10px_40px_rgba(0,240,255,0.1)]">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 bg-mesh-accent text-mesh-dark font-bold px-4 py-1 rounded-full text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">
          Suscripción Necesaria
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2 mt-2">Plan SaaS (Cloud)</h3>
        <p class="text-mesh-muted mb-6">El cerebro de tu red. Gestión de anuncios y sensores en una sola interfaz.</p>
        <div class="mb-8">
          <span class="text-5xl font-extrabold text-white">$19</span>
          <span class="text-mesh-muted">/ mes por nodo</span>
        </div>
        
        <ul class="space-y-4 mb-8 flex-grow">
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-mesh-accent mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            <span class="text-gray-300">Gestión de Publicidad y Playlists ilimitadas</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-mesh-accent mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            <span class="text-gray-300">Dashboard de Telemetría (Presión, Temp, etc.)</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-mesh-accent mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            <span class="text-gray-300">Actualizaciones remotas de contenido (OTA)</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-mesh-accent mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            <span class="text-gray-300">Almacenamiento en la nube de hasta 100GB</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        
        <a href="#contact" class="w-full block text-center bg-mesh-accent hover:bg-mesh-accentHover text-mesh-dark font-bold py-3 px-4 rounded-xl transition-colors">
          Comenzar Prueba Gratuita
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
